nver CO","description":"SVRBOU\n\nThe National Weather Service in Denver has issued a\n\n* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...\nSouthwestern Weld County in northeastern Colorado...\n\n* Until 515 PM MDT.\n\n* At 445 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Fort Lupton,\nor 23 miles south of Greeley, moving northeast at 15 mph.\n\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to\nroofs, siding, and trees.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nBrighton, Fort Lupton, Lochbuie, Platteville and Hudson.","ends":"2026-08-22T17:15:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Weld, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d3d76e902037c862bbf782cd6c4ef6edb8a6951a.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d3d76e902037c862bbf782cd6c4ef6edb8a6951a.001.1"},{"event":"Special Weather Statement","headline":"Special Weather Statement issued August 22 at 4:22PM MDT by NWS Denver CO","description":"At 422 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near\nBarr Lake, or 15 miles northeast of Denver, moving northeast at 25\nmph.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph and penny size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around\nunsecured objects. Minor damage to outdoor objects is\npossible.\n\nLocations impacted include...\nCommerce City, Brighton, northwestern Denver International Airport,\nFort Lupton, Lochbuie, Hudson, Barr Lake, Todd Creek, Wattenburg\nand Henderson.","ends":"2026-08-22T17:00:00-06:00","severity":"Moderate","areaDesc":"North Douglas County Below 6000 Feet/Denver/West Adams and Arapahoe Counties/East Broomfield County; Central and South Weld County","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.2921140a76dcbd9cc0960c9fd28cc956f95adf0f.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.2921140a76dcbd9cc0960c9fd28cc956f95adf0f.001.1"}],"afd":{"office":"BOU","issued":"2026-08-22T18:50:00+